    <h2>Design Your Perfect Space</h2>
    <p>Your home is unique, and your furniture should be too. At Mauve, many of our pieces come in a variety of colors, finishes, and fabrics, allowing you to tailor them to your personal style. From modular sofas to extendable tables, we make it simple to create a space that’s truly your own.</p>
