    <h2>Good for Your Home, Good for the Earth</h2>
    <p>Sustainability is at the heart of what we do. We source eco-friendly materials, minimize waste in production, and use responsible packaging so that your furniture not only looks good but feels good for the planet. Furnishing your home can be stylish and environmentally conscious.</p>
