    <h2>National Coverage</h2>
    <p>No matter where you are, Mauve delivers. With nationwide shipping and a network of trusted logistics partners, we make it easy to bring your favorite furniture into your home. From bustling cities to quiet towns, we ensure every order arrives safely, on time, and ready to enhance your living space.</p>
